1
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:12,846
Ji-yoon, what the fuck
are you talking about?

2
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,223
Wait a minute.

3
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,309
Ji-yoon.

4
00:00:19,185 --> 00:00:20,729
Oh no!

5
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:27,235
Damn it, where the hell am I?

6
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:31,114
Fuck.

7
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:34,659
Is anyone there?

8
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:37,746
Anyone?

9
00:00:39,998 --> 00:00:42,917
Where the hell am I?

10
00:00:52,093 --> 00:00:53,553
Excuse me!

11
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:56,389
- Look. Should we give him a ride?
- Please, I need a ride!

12
00:00:56,473 --> 00:00:59,934
- Forget it. Just go. What are we, a taxi?
- Please! No!

13
00:01:03,104 --> 00:01:04,647
Damn it.

14
00:01:09,444 --> 00:01:11,029
(OH WHATEVER)
IT'S JUST MY FATE

15
00:01:11,112 --> 00:01:13,948
<i>It's just my fate</i>

16
00:01:14,908 --> 00:01:18,036
<i>I fly high, riding the good vibes</i>

17
00:01:18,119 --> 00:01:20,747
- <i>And laugh my way out of reality</i>
- Ji-yoon, please.

18
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:23,583
Come on, turn on. Please.

19
00:01:29,214 --> 00:01:31,216
- <i>…is currently switched off.</i>
- Goddammit.

20
00:01:31,299 --> 00:01:32,300
<i>Leave a message</i>…

21
00:01:38,973 --> 00:01:43,311
SPIDER STAFFING AGENCY

22
00:01:43,895 --> 00:01:46,064
"Out on business"?

23
00:02:02,497 --> 00:02:03,331
Sir!

24
00:02:04,499 --> 00:02:05,333
Sir!

25
00:02:18,179 --> 00:02:20,181
<i>I'm out of the office right now.</i>

26
00:02:20,265 --> 00:02:23,059
<i>I don't have any part-time jobs</i>
<i>available at the moment.</i>

27
00:02:23,685 --> 00:02:26,104
<i>Ms. Ji-yoon should be fine for now.</i>

28
00:02:26,187 --> 00:02:29,357
<i>I have a lot of questions</i>
<i>for you too, Mr. Hyeok-jun.</i>

29
00:02:29,858 --> 00:02:31,067
<i>Let's meet soon.</i>

30
00:02:37,657 --> 00:02:39,742
Come on.

31
00:02:46,291 --> 00:02:52,797
EUM YEON-JOO

32
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,344
I was such an idiot to send that text

33
00:02:58,428 --> 00:03:01,639
telling her to go
to Spider Staffing Agency. Seriously.

34
00:03:04,642 --> 00:03:06,019
Then go look for her.

35
00:03:08,229 --> 00:03:11,232
If Ms. Ji-yoon is safe somewhere,

36
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:14,068
it's most likely
at today's part-time job place.

37
00:03:15,028 --> 00:03:17,530
It's supposed to be at a hospital today.

38
00:03:18,865 --> 00:03:21,868
How do I go
when they won't even give me a job?

39
00:03:21,951 --> 00:03:24,287
I can't reach them,
and the office is empty.

40
00:03:24,370 --> 00:03:26,080
If no job is offered, you steal it.

41
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:28,791
What?

42
00:03:28,875 --> 00:03:33,463
You don't think Spider Staffing Agency
only deals with you, do you?

43
00:03:37,342 --> 00:03:41,262
These are people a step ahead of you,
moving with fierce determination.

44
00:03:41,763 --> 00:03:43,765
Among them is Mr. Seon Gyeong-min.

45
00:03:44,265 --> 00:03:46,643
He is the same age and build as you.

46
00:03:47,602 --> 00:03:50,772
So you should try to take his place.

47
00:03:51,272 --> 00:03:53,149
But there's nothing we can do.

48
00:03:53,650 --> 00:03:57,862
- Unless we steal Seon's phone--
- Didn't you call me for help?

49
00:04:00,156 --> 00:04:03,868
<i>I thought ahead and got things ready.</i>
<i>We're borrowing his phone for a bit.</i>

50
00:04:04,369 --> 00:04:06,537
<i>So send "Accept"</i>
<i>and become Seon Gyeong-min.</i>

51
00:05:06,097 --> 00:05:09,767
DEAD-END JOB

52
00:05:10,977 --> 00:05:13,896
CLINICAL TRIAL

53
00:05:32,123 --> 00:05:33,291
What is this place?

54
00:05:50,933 --> 00:05:52,226
The movie theater.

55
00:06:00,151 --> 00:06:01,736
Fucking hell.

56
00:06:06,282 --> 00:06:07,367
Byeon Hyeok-jun?

57
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:16,667
A convenience store?

58
00:06:28,262 --> 00:06:30,139
What the hell is all of this?

59
00:06:48,741 --> 00:06:49,575
Oh shit.

60
00:07:21,983 --> 00:07:24,360
What the hell is this place?

61
00:07:29,782 --> 00:07:32,076
Goodness, it looks like you ran here.

62
00:07:32,577 --> 00:07:33,578
Mr. Seon Gyeong-min?

63
00:07:34,162 --> 00:07:36,706
Yes, I'm Seon Gyeong-min.

64
00:07:36,789 --> 00:07:39,542
Yes, so you are Mr. Seon Gyeong-min.

65
00:07:40,710 --> 00:07:44,005
- Are you not feeling well?
- No, I'm fine.

66
00:07:44,505 --> 00:07:46,007
- Are you sure?
- Yes.

67
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:50,178
Okay, all 16 of you are here.

68
00:07:50,678 --> 00:07:53,347
Now, I'll lead you upstairs.

69
00:07:53,431 --> 00:07:54,515
Please follow me.

70
00:07:57,977 --> 00:08:01,731
YANGCHEON BIO CLINIC, CLINICAL TRIAL
? TIMES THE DAILY WAGE, 10 P.M. - 6 A.M.

71
00:08:17,163 --> 00:08:20,583
So this is the pill
you'll be taking today.

72
00:08:21,083 --> 00:08:25,463
It's not harmful at all, so don't worry.

73
00:08:25,963 --> 00:08:29,550
It's a replica of a stress relief aid
already on the market.

74
00:08:29,634 --> 00:08:35,056
Today, you only need to take this pill
and get your blood drawn one hour later.

75
00:08:36,307 --> 00:08:37,225
Yes, stand there.

76
00:08:37,308 --> 00:08:40,561
We'll begin at the front
to draw blood and administer the pill.

77
00:08:40,645 --> 00:08:41,562
Please come forward.

78
00:08:41,646 --> 00:08:42,772
Please come this way.

79
00:08:42,855 --> 00:08:44,774
- This way, please.
- Have a seat.

80
00:08:47,401 --> 00:08:48,236
Your name, please?

81
00:08:48,319 --> 00:08:49,529
Hey, Seon Gyeong-min.

82
00:08:52,990 --> 00:08:54,617
How in the world…

83
00:08:55,993 --> 00:08:59,163
I saw your text,
so I checked out the place.

84
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:00,998
Damn it.

85
00:09:01,582 --> 00:09:04,627
<i>Spider Staffing Agency,</i>
<i>which hooks you up with super sweet gigs.</i>

86
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:09,340
- Hey, did you change your name?
- Shit.

87
00:09:09,423 --> 00:09:11,425
What's up with "Gyeong-min"? I mean--

88
00:09:11,509 --> 00:09:13,302
Let's talk later.

89
00:09:13,970 --> 00:09:16,764
Why'd you come here?
You're not even feeling well.

90
00:09:19,850 --> 00:09:22,311
Don't you dare take that pill, okay?

91
00:09:22,395 --> 00:09:24,313
It could be something weird.

92
00:09:25,731 --> 00:09:27,024
To get paid, I have to.

93
00:09:27,108 --> 00:09:29,569
- Do as I say. Just don't take it--
- Quiet, please.

94
00:09:29,652 --> 00:09:30,486
Sorry.

95
00:09:33,573 --> 00:09:35,157
Please clench your fist tight.

96
00:09:47,503 --> 00:09:48,879
You can relax now.

97
00:09:52,049 --> 00:09:53,759
You seem to be very interested.

98
00:09:56,053 --> 00:09:58,139
Here, take this.

99
00:10:01,058 --> 00:10:04,186
It could get stuck in your throat,
so drink plenty of water.

100
00:10:16,365 --> 00:10:17,283
Say "ah."

101
00:10:19,994 --> 00:10:21,329
You swallowed it, right?

102
00:10:35,051 --> 00:10:36,552
Damn it, seriously.

103
00:10:39,764 --> 00:10:40,890
Holy shit!

104
00:10:42,308 --> 00:10:44,477
This medicine actually works.

105
00:10:45,436 --> 00:10:47,438
I'm feeling quite calm.

106
00:10:48,189 --> 00:10:49,565
Goddammit, seriously.

107
00:10:51,984 --> 00:10:52,985
What should we eat?

108
00:10:53,069 --> 00:10:56,197
- Is Byeon Ji-yoon even here?
- Let's eat spicy stir-fried pork.

109
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,573
What are you talking about?

110
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,659
Hey, follow me.

111
00:11:04,997 --> 00:11:06,666
Please return to your bed.

112
00:11:06,749 --> 00:11:09,168
- I just need to use the restroom.
- Please go back!

113
00:11:10,378 --> 00:11:12,838
Mr. Seon Gyeong-min, where are you going?

114
00:11:13,673 --> 00:11:15,758
I'm just going to the restroom.

115
00:11:16,467 --> 00:11:17,635
The restroom

116
00:11:18,636 --> 00:11:21,514
can be used in an hour.
Just hold on for a bit.

117
00:11:21,597 --> 00:11:24,767
What are you talking about?
I really need to go!

118
00:11:24,850 --> 00:11:26,310
Mr. Seon Gyeong-min!

119
00:11:26,936 --> 00:11:30,147
If you don't return to your bed right now,
you'll be quarantined.

120
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:36,028
DANGER
DO NOT REMOVE PROTECTIVE SUIT

121
00:11:41,492 --> 00:11:42,993
Yes, Director, it's me.

122
00:11:43,077 --> 00:11:44,829
<i>Is everything all right?</i>

123
00:11:44,912 --> 00:11:48,416
Yes, all 17 subjects
are in good condition.

124
00:11:48,499 --> 00:11:49,709
<i>17?</i>

125
00:11:49,792 --> 00:11:51,794
<i>Weren't there 16 people in total?</i>

126
00:11:51,877 --> 00:11:56,424
There's one more person,
but they'll be transferred shortly.

127
00:11:56,507 --> 00:11:58,134
<i>That sounds good,</i>

128
00:11:58,217 --> 00:12:00,261
<i>but you must be very busy, Doctor.</i>

129
00:12:00,845 --> 00:12:01,679
Yes.

130
00:12:02,221 --> 00:12:05,015
<i>I trust</i>
<i>you'll take care of things perfectly.</i>

131
00:12:05,516 --> 00:12:06,350
Of course.

132
00:12:56,859 --> 00:12:57,818
Hurry up.

133
00:13:07,244 --> 00:13:08,078
What's with you?

134
00:13:20,674 --> 00:13:23,052
Take the cart
down to the basement after this.

135
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:41,028
Stop her!

136
00:13:53,374 --> 00:13:54,458
Fuck.

137
00:13:55,751 --> 00:13:58,754
<i>So you're saying</i>
<i>your sister might be here?</i>

138
00:13:58,838 --> 00:14:01,966
But if your sister's here,

139
00:14:02,925 --> 00:14:04,552
can't you just ask the staff?

140
00:14:10,099 --> 00:14:11,350
Hey.

141
00:14:11,851 --> 00:14:13,727
Haven't you been listening?

142
00:14:13,811 --> 00:14:18,107
This place is fucking dangerous,
you damn moron.

143
00:14:19,692 --> 00:14:22,444
Just help me out this once, okay?

144
00:14:23,904 --> 00:14:24,738
Well,

145
00:14:26,073 --> 00:14:29,869
my body's a right mess,
so I can method-act the fuck out of this.

146
00:14:30,828 --> 00:14:33,956
So this means I've paid you back
for my hospital bill, right?

147
00:14:34,832 --> 00:14:35,749
Okay.

148
00:14:36,292 --> 00:14:37,126
Actually,

149
00:14:37,668 --> 00:14:41,213
just repay the hospital bill
with frozen pork belly after this.

150
00:14:41,881 --> 00:14:44,675
You fucking love your frozen pork belly,
don't you, fool?

151
00:14:45,509 --> 00:14:46,760
Okay, let's give it a shot.

152
00:14:47,511 --> 00:14:49,680
Byeong-cheol, get ready.

153
00:14:52,016 --> 00:14:53,809
Ow, my stomach!

154
00:14:54,977 --> 00:14:56,020
Hurry!

155
00:14:57,021 --> 00:14:58,606
- It hurts so much!
- Get back inside.

156
00:14:58,689 --> 00:15:00,774
Everyone, please get back inside!

157
00:15:03,110 --> 00:15:04,862
What's wrong with him all of a sudden?

158
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:07,615
Mr. Kwak Byeong-cheol, please calm down.

159
00:15:11,035 --> 00:15:13,120
Say "ah," please.

160
00:15:14,163 --> 00:15:15,164
Next, your ears.

161
00:15:15,247 --> 00:15:16,123
My stomach hurts!

162
00:15:16,206 --> 00:15:18,876
- Why are you checking elsewhere?
- Your eyes are fine too.

163
00:15:18,959 --> 00:15:20,294
Your nose is fine too.

164
00:15:20,377 --> 00:15:23,964
There's nothing wrong with you,
so don't worry, and--

165
00:15:24,048 --> 00:15:26,300
- Doctor, that bastard's leaving!
- I need help.

166
00:15:26,383 --> 00:15:27,301
Crap.

167
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:32,014
Get him!

168
00:15:32,097 --> 00:15:33,933
- Byeon Ji-yoon, where are you?
- What the…

169
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:37,019
Hey!

170
00:15:38,228 --> 00:15:39,271
Stop right there!

171
00:15:39,355 --> 00:15:40,940
- Damn it.
- Stop!

172
00:15:42,024 --> 00:15:43,067
Get him!

173
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:44,151
Let go of me!

174
00:15:44,234 --> 00:15:45,069
Byeon Ji-yoon!

175
00:15:45,152 --> 00:15:46,820
You fucking bastards!

176
00:15:46,904 --> 00:15:49,198
Are you nuts? Let go! Let go of me now!

177
00:15:49,281 --> 00:15:50,866
What's the matter with you all?

178
00:15:50,950 --> 00:15:51,992
What are you doing?

179
00:15:52,076 --> 00:15:53,786
Someone help me!

180
00:15:53,869 --> 00:15:56,330
Someone help me! Help!

181
00:15:56,413 --> 00:15:57,373
Ji-yoon.

182
00:16:01,752 --> 00:16:02,586
Ji-yoon.

183
00:16:03,545 --> 00:16:04,505
Ji-yoon!

184
00:16:04,588 --> 00:16:07,299
Help!

185
00:16:07,383 --> 00:16:09,176
- Ji-yoon!
- Let go!

186
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:10,970
Stay still!

187
00:16:11,053 --> 00:16:12,179
Secure him!

188
00:16:12,262 --> 00:16:14,890
- Get him. Stop moving, you!
- Ji-yoon!

189
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:40,624
Hey!

190
00:16:41,125 --> 00:16:42,251
Wake up!

191
00:16:42,751 --> 00:16:43,919
Hey, get up!

192
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:45,462
Byeon Hyeok-jun!

193
00:16:46,714 --> 00:16:47,840
Byeon Hyeok-jun.

194
00:16:47,923 --> 00:16:49,216
Oh, you startled me.

195
00:16:51,969 --> 00:16:54,972
- Are you okay, Hyeok-jun?
- Ji-yoon, what are you doing here?

196
00:16:55,055 --> 00:16:57,349
Why the hell are you here?

197
00:16:58,851 --> 00:16:59,935
Never mind that.

198
00:17:00,019 --> 00:17:01,437
Untie me first. Hurry.

199
00:17:01,937 --> 00:17:03,355
Come over here.

200
00:17:03,439 --> 00:17:05,899
- Like that. No, I'll come to you.
- Damn it.

201
00:17:06,859 --> 00:17:08,068
Mine won't budge.

202
00:17:09,236 --> 00:17:10,654
- Give me your hand.
- Here.

203
00:17:11,447 --> 00:17:14,033
- No. Give me your foot.
- Okay, the foot.

204
00:17:15,993 --> 00:17:16,952
- Damn it.
- Got it?

205
00:17:17,036 --> 00:17:17,911
The sock.

206
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:20,914
- Good. Hold on.
- Untie this.

207
00:17:20,998 --> 00:17:22,166
Pull it that way, fool.

208
00:17:22,249 --> 00:17:23,333
Hold on.

209
00:17:23,834 --> 00:17:25,002
We got it!

210
00:17:25,085 --> 00:17:26,086
Holy shit.

211
00:17:26,587 --> 00:17:27,838
Quick. Over here.

212
00:17:28,714 --> 00:17:30,132
- Hey, your…
- Why?

213
00:17:30,215 --> 00:17:31,258
Your nose!

214
00:17:31,341 --> 00:17:32,426
- What?
- Your nose!

215
00:17:33,552 --> 00:17:34,386
My nose?

216
00:17:40,601 --> 00:17:42,352
What the hell is this? Holy shit!

217
00:17:42,853 --> 00:17:44,271
- Pull it out!
- No, don't pull it out!

218
00:17:44,354 --> 00:17:45,314
- What is this?
- Hurry!

219
00:17:45,397 --> 00:17:46,690
No, you can't! Not yet!

220
00:17:46,774 --> 00:17:48,776
Why'd it come out so fast?

221
00:17:53,155 --> 00:17:54,907
Stay the hell away from me!

222
00:18:25,646 --> 00:18:26,855
<i>What the hell…</i>

223
00:18:28,524 --> 00:18:29,983
<i>It wasn't the pills?</i>

224
00:18:34,363 --> 00:18:35,614
It wasn't the pills,

225
00:18:36,907 --> 00:18:37,866
but the water?

226
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:43,747
What's wrong?
Byeon Hyeok-jun, keep it together!

227
00:18:47,751 --> 00:18:48,836
Run!

228
00:18:50,295 --> 00:18:51,296
What's going on?

229
00:18:51,922 --> 00:18:52,756
No, wait!

230
00:18:54,758 --> 00:18:57,261
- Hey!
- There's a monster behind us!

231
00:18:58,345 --> 00:18:59,179
Let go of me!

232
00:19:23,912 --> 00:19:25,622
Oh fuck!

233
00:19:46,435 --> 00:19:47,895
Someone help me!

234
00:19:53,942 --> 00:19:54,943
- Get up.
- Help me!

235
00:19:55,027 --> 00:19:56,653
Snap out of it! We have to go!

236
00:19:57,779 --> 00:19:58,655
Let's go!

237
00:19:59,781 --> 00:20:01,033
Help me.

238
00:20:12,377 --> 00:20:13,712
Quick, get in!

239
00:20:14,713 --> 00:20:17,007
- Why won't it work? First floor.
- Hurry!

240
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:18,008
Come on.

241
00:20:42,324 --> 00:20:43,158
Holy shit.

242
00:20:49,998 --> 00:20:51,333
Hey.

243
00:20:59,341 --> 00:21:00,550
What the hell?

244
00:21:01,218 --> 00:21:02,427
Why is no one here?

245
00:21:04,429 --> 00:21:05,597
Let's take the stairs.

246
00:21:05,681 --> 00:21:07,557
- Hold on.
- What? Why?

247
00:21:07,641 --> 00:21:10,060
I have to check something.
Give me five seconds.

248
00:21:10,143 --> 00:21:10,978
Hey.

249
00:21:11,561 --> 00:21:13,563
I'll regret it if I don't.

250
00:21:14,064 --> 00:21:16,149
I'll be right back. Just wait here, okay?

251
00:21:16,233 --> 00:21:18,068
Byeon Hyeok-jun!

252
00:21:18,735 --> 00:21:19,778
Goddammit.

253
00:21:20,612 --> 00:21:21,905
Seriously.

254
00:21:25,617 --> 00:21:26,868
Damn it.

255
00:22:25,052 --> 00:22:26,970
<i>Byeong-cheol, get up. We have to go.</i>

256
00:22:27,054 --> 00:22:28,680
Get up! We have to go.

257
00:22:28,764 --> 00:22:29,598
Is it over?

258
00:22:29,681 --> 00:22:30,974
Far from it. Get up.

259
00:22:31,058 --> 00:22:33,352
- What about the others?
- Wait, hold on.

260
00:22:34,978 --> 00:22:35,854
What's with you?

261
00:22:35,937 --> 00:22:37,022
- Okay.
- Hey, blood.

262
00:22:37,105 --> 00:22:37,939
Get up. Let's go.

263
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:39,524
You're bleeding.

264
00:22:43,695 --> 00:22:46,448
What the hell are you doing?
Do you want us all dead?

265
00:22:47,199 --> 00:22:50,869
- Try to pull yourself together. Come on!
- But I don't get it.

266
00:22:50,952 --> 00:22:52,496
Hurry up. What are you doing?

267
00:22:52,579 --> 00:22:54,206
- Put some effort into it.
- Hurry.

268
00:22:54,289 --> 00:22:55,957
Get a hold of yourself!

269
00:22:56,041 --> 00:22:56,958
But I'm tired.

270
00:22:59,586 --> 00:23:01,129
- Is this the right way?
- Yeah.

271
00:23:02,714 --> 00:23:04,591
Slow down a bit.

272
00:23:05,092 --> 00:23:07,135
- I might throw up.
- No, we need to leave now!

273
00:23:07,219 --> 00:23:08,929
- Do it outside.
- I'm gonna throw up.

274
00:23:14,309 --> 00:23:16,603
I mean, where are we going?

275
00:23:16,686 --> 00:23:18,855
- What the hell?
- Why won't this open? Hold on.

276
00:23:19,564 --> 00:23:20,607
Hello!

277
00:23:23,110 --> 00:23:24,403
Are we trying to leave?

278
00:23:24,903 --> 00:23:26,822
But that door won't open.

279
00:23:26,905 --> 00:23:29,241
Hold on a second.

280
00:23:30,117 --> 00:23:32,869
- Who the hell is that?
- I don't know, damn it.

281
00:23:45,882 --> 00:23:49,010
Using that on me won't open that door.

282
00:23:49,845 --> 00:23:52,597
It only opens if I open it myself.

283
00:23:53,098 --> 00:23:57,144
Excuse me, ma'am.
I'm sorry, but I'm not Seon Gyeong-min.

284
00:23:57,227 --> 00:23:58,895
Forget the money. Just let us go.

285
00:23:58,979 --> 00:24:00,480
She's not here to work,

286
00:24:00,564 --> 00:24:03,191
and it's his first time today,
so he's clueless.

287
00:24:03,275 --> 00:24:05,986
- What? No, I'm here for the money--
- Shut it!

288
00:24:06,570 --> 00:24:08,822
Who the hell are you people?

289
00:24:09,322 --> 00:24:12,409
You must have a reason
for doing this to people!

290
00:24:14,828 --> 00:24:15,745
Money, of course.

291
00:24:16,746 --> 00:24:18,665
And to maintain the balance of the world.

292
00:24:21,751 --> 00:24:23,378
It's hard for you to understand,

293
00:24:23,462 --> 00:24:25,672
but the creatures you saw earlier

294
00:24:25,755 --> 00:24:28,967
suck the life force and nutrients
from human bodies.

295
00:24:29,468 --> 00:24:32,762
But we extract them
before they're fully grown

296
00:24:32,846 --> 00:24:35,432
and sacrifice them instead of humans.

297
00:24:38,226 --> 00:24:40,312
I'll make an exception
and let you three go.

298
00:24:40,395 --> 00:24:41,938
You two aren't even on the list,

299
00:24:42,022 --> 00:24:45,275
and by sacrificing our employees,
we've met the required quota.

300
00:24:46,234 --> 00:24:47,861
On humanitarian grounds.

301
00:25:01,833 --> 00:25:03,001
Let's go.

302
00:25:04,085 --> 00:25:07,172
- What about you, Mr. Byeong-cheol?
- Pardon?

303
00:25:07,255 --> 00:25:09,466
Want to finish the last ten minutes
and get paid?

304
00:25:09,966 --> 00:25:12,344
- Well…
- Hey, get a grip.

305
00:25:12,844 --> 00:25:13,678
Let's go.

306
00:25:14,221 --> 00:25:15,180
Come on, let's go.

307
00:25:18,016 --> 00:25:20,101
No, wait.

308
00:25:21,102 --> 00:25:22,354
Hold on.

309
00:25:22,437 --> 00:25:25,398
- Hey! I'm sorry.
- What are you doing?

310
00:25:25,482 --> 00:25:27,817
Don't say that, you crazy shit.
Come on, let's go!

311
00:25:27,901 --> 00:25:29,569
No, listen to me. Damn it.

312
00:25:30,070 --> 00:25:34,241
If I leave without earning a penny,
I'm dead anyway.

313
00:25:34,324 --> 00:25:35,992
I really need to make money!

314
00:25:36,076 --> 00:25:37,118
Kwak Byeong-cheol.

315
00:25:38,161 --> 00:25:39,037
Excuse me!

316
00:25:40,830 --> 00:25:41,790
Over here.

317
00:25:41,873 --> 00:25:43,625
What are you doing, you crazy bastard?

318
00:25:43,708 --> 00:25:46,586
- Hey!
- No, wait. Let go of me!

319
00:25:47,170 --> 00:25:48,588
Calm down.

320
00:25:51,132 --> 00:25:53,969
You've done enough. Please, let's go.

321
00:25:55,929 --> 00:25:58,098
Think about Mom.

322
00:25:58,598 --> 00:26:00,058
We need to go back.

323
00:26:25,917 --> 00:26:27,294
It's not your fault.

324
00:26:27,961 --> 00:26:29,045
Forget about everything.

325
00:26:38,221 --> 00:26:39,347
Your debt…

326
00:26:41,600 --> 00:26:42,851
Do you have a lot left?

327
00:26:48,398 --> 00:26:49,774
I've paid off a lot.

328
00:26:54,529 --> 00:26:55,363
Hyeok-jun.

329
00:26:58,074 --> 00:26:58,908
Yeah?

330
00:27:01,661 --> 00:27:03,413
Don't ever disappear again.

331
00:27:06,041 --> 00:27:07,334
Like Dad.

332
00:27:08,043 --> 00:27:09,669
Don't disappear like him.

333
00:27:33,109 --> 00:27:33,943
Come here.

334
00:27:35,820 --> 00:27:37,530
My son.

335
00:27:38,239 --> 00:27:39,574
What is this place?

336
00:27:39,658 --> 00:27:43,036
This is called a model home.

337
00:27:44,037 --> 00:27:45,246
ECO-FRIENDLY, CHILD-SAFE COMMUNITY

338
00:27:45,330 --> 00:27:48,083
But why are we here?

339
00:27:48,166 --> 00:27:49,584
To look at our home.

340
00:27:55,423 --> 00:27:56,383
Wow.

341
00:27:57,759 --> 00:27:58,927
It's nice.

342
00:28:03,890 --> 00:28:05,308
But Dad,

343
00:28:06,101 --> 00:28:08,353
aren't we poor?

344
00:28:09,354 --> 00:28:10,188
What?

345
00:28:11,356 --> 00:28:12,190
Hey, buddy.

346
00:28:12,982 --> 00:28:16,486
I got a really good job.

347
00:28:16,569 --> 00:28:17,904
So just wait a little.

348
00:28:17,987 --> 00:28:21,741
- I'm going to make a lot of money.
- Really?

349
00:28:21,825 --> 00:28:23,451
You're going to make a lot of money?

350
00:28:24,035 --> 00:28:24,869
I am.

351
00:28:26,329 --> 00:28:27,789
I'm going to make lots of money.

352
00:28:31,584 --> 00:28:33,169
I just need to finish this job.

353
00:28:33,670 --> 00:28:34,713
Really?

354
00:28:34,796 --> 00:28:36,589
Of course. Yeah.

355
00:28:37,757 --> 00:28:38,591
Of course.

356
00:28:41,511 --> 00:28:42,721
That job

357
00:28:44,013 --> 00:28:45,849
is a sweet deal.

358
00:28:46,474 --> 00:28:48,268
A sweet deal?

359
00:28:55,275 --> 00:28:56,735
<i>A sweet deal.</i>

360
00:28:58,194 --> 00:29:00,905
<i>And Dad disappeared after that.</i>

361
00:32:59,811 --> 00:33:04,816
Subtitle translation by: Yung Un Choi
